{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/6115bb52501fb0ecbd9b.json":{"assets":{"ep5/quest_story_15260020":{"skip":{"source_cn":"摩根站在人面树前，准备处理这些图塔镇居民的尸体。为防止腐败滋生的瘟疫扩散，处理尸体刻不容缓。幸好这里没有人指指点点，他决定之后直接焚烧尸体。","text_i18n":{"cn":"摩根站在人面树前，准备处理这些图塔镇居民的尸体。为防止腐败滋生的瘟疫扩散，处理尸体刻不容缓。幸好这里没有人指指点点，他决定之后直接焚烧尸体。","en":"Morgan stands before the Wailing Oak, ready to deal with the bodies of Tuttleton's residents. He needs to act quickly to prevent a plague. With no one around to question his actions, he decides the safest choice is to cremate the bodies.","jp":"モルガンは人面樹の前に立ち、トータス町の住民の遺体を処理しようとしていた。幸いここに彼に口出しする者はいない。腐敗による疫病拡散を防ぐため、彼は直接焼却することに決めた。","kr":"모르간은 영혼의 나무 앞에서 투타 마을 주민의 시신을 처리할 준비를 하고 있다. 부패로 인해 역병이 번지지 않도록 시신을 즉시 처리해야 한다. 그리고 다행히 이 계획을 방해하는 사람이 없어서 모르간은 바로 시신을 화장하기로 했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["15260020"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["25800"]}}}},"locales/cn/ep5/quest_story/15260020.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15260020","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15260020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1526002001:1":{"text":"你来这里做什么，新人？","source_cn":"你来这里做什么，新人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0863FC550248853F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你来这里做什么，新人？","female":"你来这里做什么，新人？","variant_male_record_index":"195216","variant_female_record_index":"195217","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1526002001":{"text":"你来这里做什么，新人？","source_cn":"你来这里做什么，新人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0863FC550248853F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你来这里做什么，新人？","female":"你来这里做什么，新人？","variant_male_record_index":"195216","variant_female_record_index":"195217","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1526002002:1":{"text":"留着那个精力去对付丰饶神吧。你不